# bola_ball_cues.voc
#
# WHAT: sport / play / round-object context — the cue that "bola" is the BALL
#       reading (open ɔ, /ˈbɔlɐ/), not the «bôla» bread/cake (closed o, /ˈbolɐ/).
# WHERE USED: bifonia/scoring.py → _resolve_bola(), weighted against
#       bola_loaf_cues.voc. The reading with the stronger (proximity-weighted)
#       cue total wins; ball is the default on a tie.
# WHY: a football sentence that happens to mention one food word ("comeu antes do
#       jogo") must not flip to the loaf reading — the sport cues outweigh it.
# HOW TO EXTEND: add only terms that signal a ball / sphere / ball-game and never a
#       loaf. One term per line, lowercase.
futebol
futebolista
jogar
joga
jogou
jogue
chutar
chuta
chutou
chuto
pontapé
remate
